### 1. Verifica connessione
@elasticUser = elastic
@elasticPassword = HYxhqLGzvE-HQbo+f3eY

### Elasticsearch locale
GET http://localhost:9200
Authorization: Basic {{elasticUser}} {{elasticPassword}}


### 2. Creazione indice BOOKS con mapping (da fare una volta sola)
PUT http://localhost:9200/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{elasticUser}} {{elasticPassword}}


< ./mapping.json

### 3. Inserimento libri tramite Bulk API (da fare una volta sola)
POST http://localhost:9200/_bulk
Content-Type: application/x-ndjson
Authorization: Basic {{elasticUser}} {{elasticPassword}}

< ./data.json

### 4. Verifica indice
GET http://localhost:9200/_cat/indices?v
Authorization: Basic {{elasticUser}} {{elasticPassword}}

### 5. Conteggio libri
GET http://localhost:9200/books/_count
Authorization: Basic {{elasticUser}} {{elasticPassword}}

### 6. Visualizzazione di tutti i libri
GET http://localhost:9200/books/_search?pretty
Authorization: Basic {{elasticUser}} {{elasticPassword}}

### 7. Ricerca per titolo
POST http://localhost:9200/books/_search
Authorization: Basic {{elasticUser}} {{elasticPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match": {
      "title": "Delitto"
    }
  }
}


### 8. Ricerca per autore
POST http://localhost:9200/books/_search
Authorization: Basic {{elasticUser}} {{elasticPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "term": {
      "author": "Fedor Dostoevskij"
    }
  }
}

### 9. Ricerca per intervallo di anni
POST http://localhost:9200/books/_search
Authorization: Basic {{elasticUser}} {{elasticPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "range": {
      "year": {
        "gte": 1900,
        "lte": 1950
      }
    }
  }
}

### 10. Aggregazione per autore
POST http://localhost:9200/books/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": 0,
  "aggs": {
    "autori": {
      "terms": {
        "field": "author"
      }
    }
  }
}

### 11. Cancellazione indice BOOKS
DELETE http://localhost:9200/books
Authorization: Basic {{elasticUser}} {{elasticPassword}}